  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COVID-19 EMERGENCY RESPONSE FACILITY
Technical Assistance component</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Financial Institutions (FIs) (banks, non-banking financial companies, leasing companies, microfinance institutions etc.) are key intermediaries for the financing and support to MSMEs. The objective of the TA package is to provide direct technical support, in the form of trainings, coaching, studies etc. to FIs that will entail indirect and direct support to MSMEs during the COVID-19 pandemic crisis and the aftermath. It aims at bringing rapid crisis solutions and recovery solutions through technical assistance.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
